      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm not versed with the SDK, but I'd assume this would be a flag at best for the app to allow it. Do other oculus quest apps allow party chat to remain enabled and are any of them multiplayer (since it might be a policy thing to now allow party chat for multiplayer titles)?",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
