  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-03-01T17:24:04.778Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Trying to introduce new Quest players to VRChat is a logistical nightmare right now. The way Quest users can talk to each other is via the Party chat mechanism in the Oculus environment. But this becomes inoperative as soon as VRChat starts. Quest users do not have access to Discord or any other voice call technology from their headset - so trying to teach a new user (who is also new to VR, usually) how to accept invites has to be done while trying to multitask the headset and a phone at the same time.. it is extremely frustrating to everyone involved.",
